    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SOUTHWESTAIRLINES\"\nJanuary 8,1991 Flight Schedule\nWERE CELEBRATING\nOUR 20™ ANNIVERSARY.\nTIME FLIES WHEN\nYOU'RE HAVING FUN.",
      "SOUTHWESTAIRLINES\nPacific\nMountain\nReno/Tahoe\nOakland\nSan Francisco\nBurbal\nLos Angeles\n(LAX).\nSan Diego\n-Albuquerque\nEl Paso\n© 1989, 1990, 1991 Southwest Airlines\nCentral\nEastern\nDetroit (City \u0026 Metro)\nChicago\n(Midway)\nAmarillo\nLubbock\nMidland/\nOdessa\nSan Antonio\nCorpus\nShrist\nKansas City\nSt. Louis\nLittle Rock\nDallas\n(Love Field)\n(Hobby \u0026\nIntercontinental\nRio Grande Valle\nHarlingen/South Padre Island)\nIndianap\nNashville •\n•New Orleans\nIf you fly frequently on Southwest\nAirlines, please send us your name and\naddress and we will place you on our\nmailing list. Mail requests to:\nSouthwest Airlines Schedule List\nP.O. Box 650331\nDallas, TX 75265-0331\nAll other correspondence should\nbe sent to:\nSouthwest Airlines Co.\nP.O. Box 36611\nDallas. TX 75235-1611"
    ],
